must remain unchanged.\\n\\n### Non-goals\\n\\n- Do not prove or alter any theorem, add helper declarations, or change the\\n  proof-debt inventory.\\n- Do not edit `MIPStarRE/QPBT.lean`, `Witnesses.lean`, `Apply.lean`, blueprint\\n  files, or paper-gap notes.\\n- Do not change any mathematical definition, theorem signature, constant, or\\n  source claim.\\n\\nThis split establishes disjoint ownership for later geometry, game-value,\\nnative-adapter, bounds, simultaneous-encoding, and final-assembly packets. Only\\nthe final assembly packet will edit `Soundness.lean`.\\n\\n### Testing\\n\\n- Direct-check `Geometry.lean`, `Game.lean`, `Soundness.lean`, the facade, and\\n  `Combining/Witnesses.lean` in dependency order.\\n- Run `lake build` and `git diff --check`.\\n- Confirm the four-file surface contains exactly six `sorry` sites: five in\\n  `Geometry.lean` and one in `Soundness.lean`, with no `admit` or new axiom.\\n- Confirm all existing declaration names and signatures are unchanged.\\n- Confirm `MIPStarRE/QPBT.lean` is untouched.\\n- Pass exact-head CI and independent review.\\n\\n---\\nStage 4.3 structural packet under #47.\\n\",\n \"closed_by\": null,\n \"reactions\": {\n  \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/issues/67/reactions\",\n  \"total_count\": 0,\n  \"+1\": 0,\n  \"-1\": 0,\n  \"laugh\": 0,\n  \"hooray\": 0,\n  \"confused\": 0,\n  \"heart\": 0,\n  \"rocket\": 0,\n  \"eyes\": 0\n },\n \"timeline_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/issues/67/timeline\",\n \"performed_via_github_app\": null,\n \"state_reason\": null,\n \"pinned_comment\": null\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
