38:+/-! ### Push-forwards of finite and uniform distributions
40:+The results of this section are not named in the paper.  They record the
41:+elementary behaviour of push-forwards of finite distributions, and of uniform
42:+distributions on finite types, that the line-point samplers of the low-degree
